{"ID":"20240522082256-dpgqs9s","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240522082256-dpgqs9s","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522082256-dpgqs9s\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522090639-4qgpg3c\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522090918-h0fmzv5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:3100,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240522090918-h0fmzv5\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"過敏性氣喘鼻塞","type":"doc","updated":"20240522090918"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240522090639-4qgpg3c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-4qgpg3c","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"初診：7/25/08"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-fdzf4tc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-fdzf4tc","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"41歲男性，中等身材，過敏性氣喘8年，以前服西藥控制，在美國4-6月時花粉季節易發作，氣喘發作時咳嗽，痰黃稠，變天時天冷易咳，睡時打鼾，會呼吸中止，平時易鼻塞。時胸悶、呼吸不暢，遇到空氣不清新，灰塵、潮濕、花粉、塵螨，尤其對蟑螂氣味過敏，平日有時咳痰，痰黃稠，感冒時胸口悶有壓迫感。"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-usjgdnt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-usjgdnt","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"問診："}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-7pwuyn4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-7pwuyn4","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"睡好，身無寒熱，雙足溫。大便3-4次/日，條狀；小便淡黃，有泡沫。不渴，平日喜喝熱茶。"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-l8u9hn1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-l8u9hn1","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胃口正常，體力還好。易項強。"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-zmcqpyr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-zmcqpyr","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"舌紅胖大，舌根苔淡黃"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-v84vh9x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-v84vh9x","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肝區褐點有圈紋，左脾區不規則"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-1ycjpym","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-1ycjpym","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"處方："}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-0ld5fq9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-0ld5fq9","updated":"20240522090654"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"柴胡三錢 黃芩三錢 鬱金五錢 龍膽草三錢"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-kh9yrdi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-kh9yrdi","updated":"20240522090656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝三錢 生白芍三錢 生薑二片炙甘草三錢 紅棗10枚"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-9vzhiqr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-9vzhiqr","updated":"20240522090656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"葛根五錢 補骨脂三錢 澤瀉五錢半夏三錢  瓜蔞仁三錢  黃連二錢"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-pzm4hn5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-pzm4hn5","updated":"20240522090657"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"蒼朮三錢 辛夷三錢 石蒼浦三錢枳實二錢"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-dirvcgj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-dirvcgj","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五付，9碗水煮成3碗，早晚飯前各一碗"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-2turhgd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-2turhgd","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8/1"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-mr67pea","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-mr67pea","updated":"20240522090756"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"服藥時初覺苦後覺甘甜有花草香味。以前夜尿2-3次，服藥一天後便不夜尿，且神清氣爽，思慮敏捷、手腳輕快，不會鼻塞。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服藥後排便色深有浮油。"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-6xyn7cl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-6xyn7cl","updated":"20240522090749"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第二天感冒後服藥便覺藥味變酸（感冒時有先服西藥，服西藥後再服中藥，藥味即變酸）。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-dz8ofj4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-dz8ofj4","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"感冒初期項強咽痛，蓋被時熱，不蓋則冷，目前已不會。（告訴患者：當時只要服葛根湯即可！）"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-l2lkni7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-l2lkni7","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"吃西藥後味覺嗅覺變差，目前胃口仍好，咽乾渴欲飲水，喝溫水。"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-utir683","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-utir683","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"之前咳黃痰現為黏稠白痰，不易咳出，痰梗咽喉，咳時汗多、頭暈。"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-31e5v8s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-31e5v8s","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胸悶，體力較差"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-ske31jv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-ske31jv","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈：較弱，且心律不整，跳跳停停"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-6ahuu79","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-6ahuu79","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"舌紅苔淡黃"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-6ftk9y7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-6ftk9y7","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"處方："}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-pghd8as","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-pghd8as","updated":"20240522090705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黃二錢  杏仁三錢  石膏二兩  炙甘草五錢  柴胡三錢  鬱金五錢"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-i6row5j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-i6row5j","updated":"20240522090705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"枳實二錢  瓜蔞實五錢  薤白三錢  桂枝三錢  炮附三錢  麥門冬三錢"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-yyn36h7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-yyn36h7","updated":"20240522090706"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"蒼朮三錢  辛夷三錢  石菖浦三錢"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-ojfr2k2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-ojfr2k2","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三付，9碗水煮成3碗，早晚飯前各一碗"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-2i0ft9x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-2i0ft9x","updated":"20240522090709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"下針："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"公孫  內關  天突  巨闕  關元  合谷  迎香"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-9x83cgz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-9x83cgz","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"在下針過程中，原本一直咳喘，便停止不再咳喘，且不胸悶，呼吸順暢，但拔針後，便會想咳。"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-61hcvp4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-61hcvp4","updated":"20240522090808"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8/2電訪：8/1當晚因咳喘發作劇烈，胸悶呼吸不暢，感覺只有在吐氣而不能吸氣，無法走路，送急診（以前也常如此），吸支氣管擴張劑後再追加一針劑，打針後胸悶喘的感覺稍微好一點，後來回家後身體並不覺得有好轉的感覺，患者自訴西醫處理後體力萎靡不振，只覺得呼吸比較好一點，從醫院回來後"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"只能坐著睡不能躺著睡，平躺時感覺胸口有人壓著，痰一湧便想咳痰"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，後來因繼續服用中藥後才可以平躺，目前已可平躺睡。"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-7btmrl0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-7btmrl0","updated":"20240522090818"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8/5電訪：近二日"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"凌晨3-5點易咳"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，今日"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"排便水瀉且表面有泡沫黏稠痰狀物出現（患者自訴從沒有這種情況發生）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。胃口很好，易餓想吃東西，體力還好。"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-sbxc6i7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-sbxc6i7","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8/8"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-zlbw1vz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-zlbw1vz","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"剛服藥時覺得藥味苦酸難喝，8/6服藥時則覺得苦甘甜但不香，8/7則覺得會香，味覺恢復。"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-1emlph4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-1emlph4","updated":"20240522090821"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"近來數日一直覺得很餓，很想找東西吃，感覺好像沒有吃飽，吃完東西感覺很快消化完；問其是否會"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"口渴"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，答曰：會口渴，喝溫水，但一直喝溫水很難過，就改喝茶（患者平日有喝茶習慣）。為了止咳潤喉，有喝川貝枇杷膏，但服用後咽喉會覺得酸，並不覺得舒服，喝完後反而更多痰，更難過。"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-2i1cw0o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-2i1cw0o","updated":"20240522090826"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"早上排便時，有泡沫黏稠痰狀物排出，且咳痰時所吐出的痰與如廁排出的痰一樣黏稠，痰白如同鼻涕經過勾芡般黏稠難出"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，12小時後痰的黏稠度減低，排便水瀉，一天排便三次，排便後就會大汗淋漓。"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-k79r5mp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-k79r5mp","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"近日排便排出痰狀物漸減，咳痰依舊，痰白帶黃泡沫狀，曾有咳出血絲"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-m9mh7pk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-m9mh7pk","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大便：3次，以前一天5次，大便時成型時軟散"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-c1pl13a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-c1pl13a","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"很容易口渴"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-8asg5st","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-8asg5st","updated":"20240522090835"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"痰聲呼嚕，喉中如水雞聲，凌晨3—5點易咳"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，咳痰，痰白偏黃有泡沫"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-d9169e2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-d9169e2","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胸悶仍有，體力還好。"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-084bvq7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-084bvq7","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"咳痰時咽不癢而是從氣管深處發出，當氣上逆到一定程度時，呼吸時就會聽到咽喉有痰聲呼嚕，感覺有東西在咽喉裏動，此時就想咳痰，痰黏稠不易咳，咳痰頻繁故咽痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-wqq4mp1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-wqq4mp1","updated":"20240522090837"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"不怕冷，會覺得熱，手很熱，身體內部一直在散發熱氣，故覺很渴，吃水梨後便覺得舒服（鼓勵患者口渴時可吃水梨解渴）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-wwvwmis","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-wwvwmis","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"身體均勻流汗"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-j7v4ouc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-j7v4ouc","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"體力恢復七成，心情開朗許多"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-me88udq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-me88udq","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"排尿順"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-uw186ih","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-uw186ih","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"舌紅苔黃厚"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-usychmf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-usychmf","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈：時跳時停，右脈大於左脈"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-coyct0r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-coyct0r","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"現在到地下室車庫或是空氣不新鮮處，不舒服的感覺減輕許多，比較能適應。感覺胸腔壓力仍有但壓力大減，仍有胸悶感，鼻腔到咽喉處覺得乾沒有潤滑感。"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-glqmb6n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-glqmb6n","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"睡眠：一覺到天亮，除了夜晚3 — 5點咳痰。"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-pee4rwm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-pee4rwm","updated":"20240522090718"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"針："},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"公孫  內關  列缺  照海  後谿  申脈  天突  巨闕  中脘  關元"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-a6h9hjb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-a6h9hjb","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"處方："}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-bkv6dya","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-bkv6dya","updated":"20240522090725"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"瓜蔞實五錢  薤白三錢  枳實二錢  桂枝三錢  炙甘草三錢"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-kzymsxx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-kzymsxx","updated":"20240522090726"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"柴胡三錢  鬱金五錢  射干三錢  麻黃二錢  紫菀三錢  款冬花三錢"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-aj5yl97","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-aj5yl97","updated":"20240522090727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"半夏三錢  生薑三片  五味子三錢  細辛二錢  炮附三錢  知母五錢"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-a44zif2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-a44zif2","updated":"20240522090727"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"石膏四兩  紅棗十枚  桔梗六錢"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-dvpiecb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-dvpiecb","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五付"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-3g46d39","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-3g46d39","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8/15"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-bedmlgn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-bedmlgn","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服藥期間每天固定在早上10點半開始，右太陽穴、右頰車、右迎香會緊抽痛及鼻子周圍三角地帶不適，到中午12—2點不適感達高峰，有時會疼痛得很難過，人就會不舒服、心情煩躁，但到3—4點後就不會抽痛了。近二天服藥就沒有痛感再發生。（藥力正在衝撞不通的地方，所以患者在服藥後曾有暝眩頭暈的感覺，待阻塞處衝開後，便豁然開朗！）"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-gtaha3y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-gtaha3y","updated":"20240522090856"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"這次藥吃完覺得"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"氣脈通暢，到不同地方，不論空氣充足或稀薄，胸腔不覺得有壓力，而且已不鼻塞了，以前練功時吸氣到胸腔易有阻塞感，現在吸氣比以前更深、更有飽足感，而且運氣時手馬上有熱氣充斥，與以前比較速度快很多。感覺意到氣到。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-3us48g7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-3us48g7","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"現在已不咳嗽，但睡覺之前及早晨醒來會咳痰一次，痰易咳不黏，痰色淡黃。"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-sps59zt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-sps59zt","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"白天工作時精神佳不易累，精神集中。"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-7qe9xto","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-7qe9xto","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大便：3次，晨醒、早餐後及睡前各一次。"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-d5nv7xh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-d5nv7xh","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小便：正常，不會夜尿，以前夜尿2次。"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-o00t22n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-o00t22n","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"胃口：已恢復正常，不像之前那樣易餓。"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-pksjeo1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-pksjeo1","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"口渴：不會，已恢復像以往。"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-chjtwhd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-chjtwhd","updated":"20240522090900"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"身體非常輕鬆，以前沒有這種感覺（從來沒有這麼舒服過！）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-mxgbm7j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-mxgbm7j","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈結代"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-6x7m4hq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-6x7m4hq","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"舌淡紅苔白，舌苔比上次淡多了，上次膩而且黃厚。"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-tztir3z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-tztir3z","updated":"20240522090732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"瓜蔞實五錢  薤白三錢  枳實二錢  桂枝三錢  炙甘草三錢  柴胡三錢"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-25r9kjq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-25r9kjq","updated":"20240522090733"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"鬱金五錢  半夏三錢  射干三錢  麻黃二錢  紫菀三錢  款冬三錢  生薑三片  五味子三錢  細辛二錢  炮附三錢  桔梗六錢  紅棗十個  天花粉三錢"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-hfa7o9z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-hfa7o9z","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"三付"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-66tfehb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-66tfehb","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8/25"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-05y87rz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-05y87rz","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鼻通、耳通，額竇不痛，以前氣壓變化時例如坐飛機時額竇易痛"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-l0xdzqm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-l0xdzqm","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"精神體力好，嗅覺，不想聞的東西都聞的到；聽覺比以前靈敏。"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-mp4mgac","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-mp4mgac","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"舌裂色淡紅苔淡黃"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-ed7ai2c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-ed7ai2c","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"脈結代"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-rfnmies","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-rfnmies","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"咳痰痰白有泡沫"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-gqxmnm2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-gqxmnm2","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此藥苦甘但不香"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-m6npgeg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-m6npgeg","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9/8"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-qowv7g2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-qowv7g2","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"近日大陸行，到長白山海拔2680公尺，一路呼吸順暢，體力好"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-ukr9q8z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-ukr9q8z","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"吃烏梅丸後，晨起咳痰，痰黃稠，有些有點硬硬的，不易咳出。排便順。"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-2sz49ah","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-2sz49ah","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"患者後來回美國工作，到聖誕節時再回台灣繼續治療脈結代的症狀！"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-psdiabn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-psdiabn","updated":"20240522090905"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"後記："},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-8qmf19n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-8qmf19n","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    有是症，用是藥！初診藥方中含有龍膽草及黃芩、黃連等苦藥，患者服藥後竟然不會覺得藥苦而覺得甘甜有花香味，且服藥後神清氣爽！此結果正印證老師所說：如果藥對症，即使是苦藥，也會覺得很好喝！不料患者隔日便感冒，吃完西藥後傷到腸胃，味覺嗅覺變差，吃東西都覺得酸！治療過程中，患者在服藥後排便時會排出黏稠痰狀物，患者自訴從來沒有這種經驗，且排出後胸腔壓力大減，呼吸順暢許多。脾為生痰之源，肺為貯痰之器，肺開竅於鼻！患者肺中積存許多痰濕，所以胸悶鼻塞多年，待痰濕除去，呼吸順暢，肺金能生腎水，故體力大增，夜尿次數減少，其妻發現患者睡眠時打呼頻率及音響降低許多而且較不會呼吸中斷，能睡得更沉！"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-40gwii1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-40gwii1","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    此案例使我想起老師治療一乳癌患者，當多年未來的月經一經排出，胸腔壓力大減，乳癌病情獲得控制且好轉許多；而此過敏氣喘患者如果依舊使用西藥控制，將來有可能產生肺部病變或是心臟受損！患者平日生活單純，注意飲食而且有在練氣功，病情陳訴也很清楚，如此可幫助病情的掌控及改善！"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-cxqypto","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-cxqypto","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"    "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"台北學生 張醫師 敬上"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-a5nz4bn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-a5nz4bn","updated":"20240522090916"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"老師評語 : "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"很棒很棒，這就是標準經方家的治療效果，老師以這位年輕中醫師學生為榮，如此下去，其將來實力 是無可限量的。"}]},{"ID":"20240522090639-d4kknqo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090639-d4kknqo","updated":"20240522090639"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"漢唐中醫 倪海廈謹記於佛州2008年10月15日"}]},{"ID":"20240522090917-st6rtlc","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240522090917-st6rtlc"}},{"ID":"20240522090918-h0fmzv5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240522090918-h0fmzv5"}}]}